<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="672188"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1761962290"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="You"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="雪野五月"/><amll:meta key="album" value="You"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:14.516"><div begin="00:28.170" end="04:08.276"><p begin="00:28.170" end="00:31.386" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I wanna wake up where you are</p><p begin="00:43.681" end="00:46.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">I wanna wake up where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也在抬头仰望吧</span></p><p begin="00:49.242" end="00:50.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Everyday</p><p begin="00:53.030" end="00:54.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Here in this moment</p><p begin="00:56.662" end="00:58.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Where nothing can change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被授予纯白的羽翼</span></p><p begin="00:59.089" end="01:02.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">I wanna wake up where you are</p><p begin="01:30.071" end="01:33.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I wanna wake up where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">微风啊 繁星啊</span></p><p begin="01:45.623" end="01:48.764" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I wanna wake up where you are</p><p begin="02:01.089" end="02:04.359" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">I wanna wake up where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想试着稍稍向你闹个脾气</span></p><p begin="02:06.691" end="02:08.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Everyday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你困扰的表情</span></p><p begin="02:10.397" end="02:12.349" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Here in this moment</p><p begin="02:14.099" end="02:16.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Where nothing can change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可爱的让人受不了</span></p><p begin="02:16.488" end="02:19.694" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">I wanna wake up where you are</p><p begin="02:31.950" end="02:35.235" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I wanna wake up where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">传达这份思念吧 风啊 星星啊</span></p><p begin="02:37.603" end="02:38.904" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Everyday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还在坚信着等待着</span></p><p begin="02:41.422" end="02:43.086" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Here in this moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧紧注视 这份思念吧</span></p><p begin="02:45.145" end="02:46.947" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Where nothing can change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">微风啊 繁星啊</span></p><p begin="02:47.561" end="02:50.766" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I wanna wake up where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">代替我 直到那一天吧</span></p><p begin="03:02.970" end="03:06.239" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">I wanna wake up where you are</p><p begin="03:18.511" end="03:21.743" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I wanna wake up where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待我们相见的那一天</span></p><p begin="03:34.031" end="03:37.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">I wanna wake up where you are</p><p begin="03:49.471" end="03:52.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">I wanna wake up where you are</p><p begin="04:04.906" end="04:08.276" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">I wanna wake up where you are</p></div></body></tt>